00:01.141 --> 00:03.011
Congratulations on completing this course.

00:03.419 --> 00:06.131
You've learned how to use Pydantic to bring structure,

00:06.131 --> 00:10.150
reliability, and validation to all your LLM powered applications.

00:10.740 --> 00:12.634
And beyond that, you've learned some core

00:12.634 --> 00:14.531
data validation skills that can be helpful

00:14.531 --> 00:16.548
in whatever software system you're building.

00:16.548 --> 00:19.449
where you need to pass data from one component to the next.

00:19.449 --> 00:22.548
With this course, you've built a really solid foundation.

00:22.548 --> 00:25.068
And with that being said, there's a lot more

00:25.068 --> 00:27.778
to pydantic than we were able to cover in this course.

00:27.778 --> 00:30.458
So, I hope you'll continue to learn and grow your skills

00:30.458 --> 00:32.478
and I look forward to seeing what you build.